{"id":9582873717,"name":"[PART 2!🎆] Fight The Monsters: Revamped","desc":"FIXED FIGHT THE MONSTERS (FTM)\nGAMEPASSES ARE TRANSFERRED.\n\nIn FIGHT THE MONSTERS! Battle dangerous creatures across a vast world. Collect and use 800+ weapons and face massive megabosses that test your strength.\n\nNew Content:\n\n~Summary~\nThis week's update is focused on making the game easier for casual players \nwhile still helping the veterans! Features such as the Abyssal Market, \nincreased damage bonuses, and rebalanced enemy scaling all combine to \nmake the game more enjoyable, with more long-term goals and incentives \nbrought by the Abyssal Market! Also brought along is a series of quality-of-life \nchanges that should make the game better and an opportunity to get a head \nstart in the Halloween Event!\n\n\nRECENT UPDATES:\nGAME REWORK\n\nORIGINAL:\nhttps://www.roblox.com/games/152332999/FIGHT-THE-MONSTERS-READ-DESCRIPTION\n\nTags:\nFIGHT THE MONSTERS FIGHT THE MONSTERS REMAKE FIGHT THE MONSTERS FIXED RPG MMORPG","path":"/game/9582873717-fight-the-monsters-revamped","slug":"9582873717-fight-the-monsters-revamped","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f6c5199e2427cc425bf3c2ebb82186488dde454799ffc0996fae704a273649a0.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-9e7a0b468c198a2f7ab1112b7c506528/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":36,"visitor":2582353,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-17T00:34:48.025Z","creator":{"name":"Knxll Studio","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"6a5978a86a3bf36ee0453e65","title":"SAUCE HUB","game":{"_id":"686e8bf4e1763d2301c2ea45","gameId":9582873717,"name":"[PART 2!🎆] Fight The Monsters: Revamped","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6254310afa77921e861def8806a7bea68871e091a0b0b830d4afb0531bc3ae8c.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-b602148fd08ac261a3fd3893b1bd832a-c6ba5bae70c8.png"},"slug":"9582873717-figh